**/.metro-health-check*
**/metro-cache/

# prisma generated artifacts
**/.prisma/

# Android binary artifacts (should never be committed)
**/*.aar
# gradle-wrapper.jar is the only .jar that should be committed (it's tiny & required)
# Exclude any .jar that lands outside the gradle wrapper location
mobileApplication/*.jar
backend/*.jar
